 "category": "accents",
 "description": {
  "id": "Label callout terbang mengikuti busur atau jalur SVG bebas, berputar mengikuti arah garis singgung, lalu tegak kembali saat berhenti supaya terbaca. Masuk melengkung, diam, lalu keluar melengkung; jejak tipis tergambar di belakangnya. Tanpa plugin MotionPath.",
  "en": "A callout flies along an arc or any SVG path with tangent rotation, levels out at rest for legibility, then exits on a curve, leaving a thin trail. Curved entry and exit without the MotionPath plugin."
 },
